<title>USA: Chiron, Metra assay approved.</title>
<headline>Chiron, Metra assay approved.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiron Corp's Chiron Diagnostics said it received U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance to market ACS:Dpd, a bone resorption immunoassay based on technology developed by Metra Biosystems Inc.</p>
<p>The ACS:Dpd assay measures bone density loss with a urine test.</p>
